{
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Under POL-RD-01 the governing distance is gps_trace.trace_distance_km, not the trip record's rounded copy: 10.78 km against a stored optimal of 7.2 km is an excess of 3.58 km, or 49.72% of optimal. That clears the establishment gates (greater than 20% and greater than 0.8 km), which the driver does not contest, but it clears neither materiality gate: 49.72% is not greater than 50% of optimal and 3.58 km is not greater than 8.0 km absolute. The deviation is therefore established but NOT material, so the POL-RD-06 driver-profile check is not triggered and the FULL_REFUND uplift needed to support the rider's demand for the whole $26.04 is unavailable on this record.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00106", "EV-TRIP-00106"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-01", "POL-RD-06"],
      "relies_on": "derived.deviation.excess_pct",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Where the deviation stands and no exculpatory clause fully excuses it, POL-RD-02 makes the remedy arithmetic rather than discretionary: recomputed_fare = (3.80 base + 0.75 x 7.2 optimal km + 0.28 x 19.0 optimal min) x surge 1.0 recorded on the fare breakdown + 0.80 platform fee + 0.00 ERP on the optimal route = 15.32. The refund is charged_total 26.04 less 15.32 = 10.72, rounded up to the nearest $0.05, i.e. 10.75. That is a PARTIAL_REFUND of 10.75, which is 41.2% of the charged total and far short of the 90% share that would convert it into a FULL_REFUND under POL-RD-02.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00106", "EV-TRIP-00106"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.recomputed_fare",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The rider's insistence that the $5.50 of ERP be returned in addition to the distance refund is a double count and is forbidden by POL-RD-09(1). The recomputed fare already includes only gantries lying on the optimal route, and the optimal route carries 0.00 of ERP, so the whole 5.50 of off-route ERP is comprehended inside the 10.72 difference. Adding the ERP line again would produce 16.25 — exactly the arithmetic error POL-RD-09(1) exists to prevent. The ERP is itemised separately for transparency and is not added on top.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00106", "EV-GPS-00106"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-09"],
      "relies_on": "derived.erp_lines.off_optimal_route_total",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Neither ERP line is a phantom charge that could be refunded as a standalone correction under POL-RD-09(4). The CTE (Braddell Rd towards City) gantry is matched by a trace fix at 0.0 m and the CTE (Chin Swee Rd tunnel) gantry by a fix at 24.1 m, both well inside the 250 m match radius, and the fare breakdown carries no airport surcharge at all (0.00), so no billing-integrity defect exists. Nor is POL-RD-09(2) engaged: that limb requires a POL-RD-03 exoneration for an external event, and no such exoneration exists on this record. No standalone pass-through correction is available to the rider.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00106", "EV-FARE-00106"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-09"],
      "relies_on": "derived.erp_gantry_proximity.lines",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The driver's profile does not support the repeat-deviation finding POL-RD-06 requires, so none of that clause's three effects can fire. deviation_flags_90d is 0 and completed_trips_90d is 96: the first limb (3 or more flags) fails, and the second limb (a ratio of 0.05 or more with at least 40 completed trips) fails at 0.00. Limbs (a), (b) and (c) — resolution of a balanced case for the rider, the FULL_REFUND uplift, and the conduct referral — are all unavailable, and no other field on either profile may be used to ground an adverse finding against the driver (POL-GEN-01).",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-DPROF-00106"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-06", "POL-GEN-01"],
      "relies_on": "driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Even the reduced figure does not move automatically. The monetary effect of the 10.75 partial refund exceeds the SGD 8.00 execution threshold set on this policy file, so under POL-GEN-05 the ruling is issued but not executed: the amount is held and the case is placed in the human queue for release, where a reviewer confirms execution or converts the matter to review.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00106"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-GEN-05"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.charged_total",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    }
  ]
}

