    {
      "claim": "DISCLOSURE: the traffic advisory EV-ADVIS-00106-01 is MISSING with weight_multiplier 0.0 and no payload. Its absence is citable and it defeats any traffic excuse: with no advisory naming a road the optimal route traverses, POL-RD-03 cannot be run on this record, and under POL-RD-13 and POL-RD-08 an uncited external-cause assertion carries no weight and neither reduces the excess nor supplies an amended optimal.",
      "side": "RIDER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-00106-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
    }
  ]
}

